{"id":"causa","lemma":"causa","pos":"noun","rank":742,"glosses":["cause","lawsuit"],"ipa":"/ˈkausa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"causas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-causa.wav","examples":[{"text":"No sé la causa.","en":"I don't know why.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442534"},{"text":"La epilepsia puede tener distintas causas.","en":"Epilepsy can have various causes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64705"},{"text":"¿Cuál es la causa?","en":"What's the cause?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444098"},{"text":"La investigación en las causas del cáncer es muy costosa.","en":"Investigating the causes of cancer is very expensive.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64709"},{"text":"No conozco la causa.","en":"I don't know the cause.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722066"}]}